<title>MEXICO: Saltillo unit links up with Swedish firm.</title>
<headline>Saltillo unit links up with Swedish firm.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cifunsa, a unit of Mexico's Grupo Industrial Saltillo SA de CV, said Thursday it had signed a contract with Sintercast of Sweden to develop autoparts production.</p>
<p>The company, in a statement sent to the Mexican Stock Exchange, said it would install a Sintercast 1000 system at one of its plants for engine and cylinder part production.</p>
<p>--Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom 525 7289562</p>
